	quest.2FE5FA336D0A19D2.quest_desc: [
		"FTB Ultimine is a veinmining mod included in this pack. But! It requires you to do some work to access it."
		"First get these items and put them inside the Skills Record. Then get some paper and dye."
		"Put the paper in the Skills Record and craft together the pen with the dye to fill the pen up with ink."
		"When this is done you can access tasks you have to do in order to level up your mining skills."
		"Later levels can also be bought from the shop."
		"When you have mastered all 4 mining skills you can craft a permit to unlock vein mining permanently."
	]
